@Logic
script FieldMonsterCatalog extends Logic
    -- Extracted Mob.wz / MobSkill data: GMS v83 first, v206 only for later monsters.
    -- Sources are retained per species; official MSW resource packs supply visuals/audio.
    -- Project adaptation: original attack/contact ratios use the world's level damage curve.
    -- Guard and healing values are mapped to this world's damage/HP scale, not the original client formula.
    -- Pixels -> world units: /100; WZ positive Y points down. Times are seconds.
    -- Shade's skill1 animation is absent from the official pack: keep its native pose.
    method table All()
        -- Cache immutable source profiles once per execution context.
        if self._T.profiles~=nil then return self._T.profiles end
        local data={}
